## Implementation

- Durable Object container on port 4000 with `sleepAfter = "10m"` and `enableInt
ernet = false`.
- Only the five required production variables enter the container.
- `COMMONPLACE_SIDECAR_URL` is absent from deployed container configuration.
- `storage.internal` is registered through `outboundByHost`.
- Wrong hosts receive 403 before any transport call.
- The deployed realm URL comes from `COMMONPLACE_LOG_REALM_URL`.
- Container-provided authorization is deleted and replaced from the Worker-only
